    "title": "🧪 Group assignment — 30.0%|||🧪 Group assignment — 30.0%",
    "slug": "ipr102-flm-thi-1",
    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Group assignment 30.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IPR102 · Assessment 1/4</span>\n<h2>Group assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14064 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IPR102 · Đầu điểm 1/4</span>\n<h2>Group assignment</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14064 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">Follow lecturer's proposal</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1, CLO2, CLO5, CLO6, CLO7, CLO8</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Group project</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Knowledge and skills of design rights protection and enforcement</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">In class and home conducted from assinged topic until oral presentation<br>'- Students will work in teams of 4–5 to research a company, design a brand identity (including logo, color palette, typography, and visual style), and prepare a legal analysis to ensure the proposed identity is free from copyright or trademark conflicts. The final deliverables will include a design portfolio, a written report, and a group presentation.<br>Phase 1: Research &amp; Analysis<br>'Goal: Understand the company and its branding context.<br>Tasks:<br>- Select or create a company (real or fictional).<br>- Research its mission, target audience, competitors, and market positioning.<br>- Study other existing brand identities in the same industry.<br>- Begin exploring legal frameworks: copyright, trademark, and brand protection.<br>AI Applications:<br>-Use AI to summarize company profiles and competitor analysis.<br>- Ask AI to explain branding trends and legal concepts in simple terms.<br>- Generate SWOT analysis or brand positioning maps.<br>Phase 2: Design &amp; Report Writing (self-handling by group of students)<br>Goal: Create the brand identity and justify its legal safety.<br>Tasks:<br>- Design logo, color palette, typography, and visual style.<br>- Prepare mockups (e.g., packaging, website, business cards).<br>- Write a report including:<br>+ Brand rationale<br>+ Legal analysis (trademark search, copyright considerations)<br>+ Justification of originality and legal safety.<br>Phase 3: Presentation &amp; Defense<br>Goal: Pitch the brand identity and defend its legal validity.<br>Tasks:<br>- Deliver a 10-minute group presentation.<br>- Explain the design concept and legal analysis.<br>- Respond to questions and challenges from peers or instructors.<br>AI Applications:<br>- Use AI to generate slide outlines and talking points.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">In class and home</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 1 — Introduction to studying methods: textbooks, suggested readings, rules set out by Lecturer, syllabus, assessment, legal reasoning; instruct…</li><li>Session 3 — Introducing AI tools and general guidance on using these tools in relating to this subjec (group assignment, defense arguments, researching…</li><li>Session 34 — Case study &amp; Individual assignment</li><li>Session 35 — Case study &amp; Individual assignment</li><li>Session 36 — Case study &amp; Individual assignment</li><li>Session 55 — Group assignment (moot court or presentation)</li><li>Session 56 — Group assignment (moot court or presentation)</li><li>Session 57 — Group assignment (moot court or presentation)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 1 — Introduction to studying methods: textbooks, suggested readings, rules set out by Lecturer, syllabus, assessment, legal reasoning; instruct…</li><li>Buổi 3 — Introducing AI tools and general guidance on using these tools in relating to this subjec (group assignment, defense arguments, researching…</li><li>Buổi 34 — Case study &amp; Individual assignment</li><li>Buổi 35 — Case study &amp; Individual assignment</li><li>Buổi 36 — Case study &amp; Individual assignment</li><li>Buổi 55 — Group assignment (moot court or presentation)</li><li>Buổi 56 — Group assignment (moot court or presentation)</li><li>Buổi 57 — Group assignment (moot court or presentation)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=IPR102\">Exam Room — IPR102</a> (2 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=IPR102\">Phòng thi — IPR102</a> (2 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
